  "chain": "improperly installed gasket / ineffective prior corrective action [cause A] -> foreign gasket material lodges in oil supply line -> oil leak from inboard bearing housing + partial blockage of oil cooler line -> ACC Pump A inoperable for 6d21h49m (exceeds 72h AOT, TS-prohibited condition) [backup: opposite CCW/ACC train remained operable]",
